<zk>
    <label multiline="true">
        1. Run an accessibility audit (e.g., Chrome Lighthouse → Accessibility)
        2. Check the “signature” buttons in the UI
        3. Signature buttons should provide an accessible name by adding `aria-label`
        4. Click "set undo label": the undo button is named "Back"; click "clear undo label": it is named "Undo" again
    </label>
	<signature id="sig" width="500px" height="500px"/>
	<button id="setLabel" label="set undo label" onClick='sig.setUndoLabel("Back")'/>
	<button id="clearLabel" label="clear undo label" onClick="sig.setUndoLabel(null)"/>
</zk>
